comments[7]:
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T20:27:44.831Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Tracing both reusable workflows and reproducing the changelog conflict in an isolated Git fixture before changing the publication scope. Compatibility must preserve named caller scripts, explicitly disabled hooks, and declared generated outputs."
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T20:36:29.803Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Confirmed nine cited gated-sync pull requests include CHANGELOG.md. The compatibility fixture now publishes only the imported item and history with the pending-aware build, passes the caller check, and both remaining proposals merge cleanly after the first sibling lands. The workflow probe reads only the caller-local launcher. Automatic legacy defaults, explicit scripts and artifact generation retain their invocation contract."
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T20:39:45.655Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: Follow-up #300 tracks the existing caller pins and the pm-vcs bundle generator that stages the regenerated changelog before computing its artifact. The independent strict-wrapper exit decisions already have unbraind/pm-changelog#385. No downstream workflow or package was edited.
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T20:42:27.392Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Revert proof with pre-fix workflow behavior and the pending-aware main changelog build: the sync candidate conflicted after merging sibling one. Both explicit hook controls also failed on the missing deprecation and the migration contract failed against the pre-fix docs. The fixed sibling test passed with a tracker-only push into the disposable remote and a pending-only caller check."
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T20:55:21.821Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Isolated behavior reverts failed 5/5 checks: removing automatic legacy generation failed the real tagged sync and closeout checks, skipping the explicit hook failed its pre-hook assertion in both workflows, and dropping restoration rejected the modern closeout artifact proposal at the changed-path gate. The same fixed cases passed with the Bun-installed archives in the PM-linked run, which passed 11/11. The two real tarballs exposed the expected capability under npm and native Bun launchers."
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T21:12:07.189Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: Both publication path tests failed when the old allowlist included CHANGELOG.md and passed after restoring pending mode. The offline fixture and both real packed npm and Bun caller runs passed. The shared object-store privacy gate surfaced four identity findings on two older unreachable commits outside every named ref. The isolated base and staged patch audits passed on 4665 and 4682 objects respectively.
    edited_at: "2026-11-27T21:13:40.373Z"
  - created_at: "2026-11-27T21:39:00.807Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Local targeted evidence covers 1025 tests: the main batch reported 992/996, including all 186 closeout decision cases. The two setup refusals loaded the earlier helper and passed 2/2 on the final helper. Both shared-store privacy failures passed in the 26/26 isolated rerun. The two additional workflow-reference files passed 29/29. The npm and Bun packed cases each passed 11/11, and the offline fixture and scope controls passed 3/3. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint and identity inventory passed. CI will verify the pushed head."
